        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cdk-detail" value="Single cdk deploy provisions all resources:&#xa;  DynamoDB table (on-demand, PITR, deletion protection in prod)&#xa;  Lambda functions (reserved concurrency, 30-day log retention, env vars for TABLE_NAME + MODEL_ID)&#xa;  API Gateway (WAF integration, usage plans, rate limits)&#xa;  AWS Amplify app hosting&#xa;  IAM roles (least-privilege per function)&#xa;  CloudWatch log groups + dashboards + alarms&#xa;  SNS topic for alarm notifications&#xa;Outputs: API_GATEWAY_URL · AMPLIFY_APP_URL" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
